      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_30",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("At last we have reunited with the farmers at Southport, Wesnoth’s southernmost bastion of civilization. Ethiliel, will you finally tell us what evil it is we flee from? I have trusted you thus far, but even trust has its limits."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("...I couldn’t admit it to myself, Deoran. I couldn’t before, and now that he is almost upon us—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_8",
            type: "Skeleton",
            side: 2,
            x: 10,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_8",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_9",
            type: "Skeleton Archer",
            side: 2,
            x: 13,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_9",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Mebrin",
            type: "Lich",
            side: 2,
            x: 11,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Mebrin",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("Ethiliel... At last, the student reunites with her master. Why do you flee from me?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Mebrin. I sensed it, but I did not want to believe. ...I could not bear to believe."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("<b><i>This</i></b> is the sage Mebrin? Urza Afalas was right! He has gone mad with power and transformed himself into a lich!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("Mad? I am furious!! Those accursed mudlings took me and tormented me, tortured me for sport! I knew that once the first strand of black magic left my hands, there would be no turning back. But I would suffer this humiliation no longer..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Mebrin..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("I taught the summoning of powers beyond the control of the feeble mudlings, powers that fed upon their race’s filth and greed. Content with only meagre tricks, they never even noticed as I slowly brought them under my thrall! The Urza brothers sought to enslave me, but it is they who became my slaves in the end."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Mebrin, please..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("I am called Mal M’Brin now, Ethiliel. It is the name I took when I unchained myself from the shallow-mindedness of the elves and passed over into enlightenment. In a way, I am grateful to these humans. They, though indirectly, have opened my eyes to power I would have never thought possible."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Ethiliel, we can’t keep running! I know you don’t want to fight your mentor, but he has been consumed by the dark magic! We have no choice!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("I— I’m so sorry."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Ethiliel",
            x: 2,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "stored_ethiliel",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Ethiliel",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("She’s gone!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("No matter. In time she will join me... and in the now, I will finally begin taking my vengeance on humanity, in return for all the suffering your race has inflicted upon me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Deoran",
          },
          {
