            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("You see, mortals? This is the might of a true elf; the chosen people of Irdya. The bones of Urza Afalas’s warriors serve only to swell my own ranks."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("And besides... the horses are tired, the men are tired and I’m tired as well. The undead can march day and night without rest, but we can’t. Our only choice is to fight, as unlikely as our victory may be."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("What?! But fighting alone— such a thing will mean certain death! If we stand here together, there is at least a chance we might prevail!"),
          },
          {
